t(21, 2260, """A nation that loves work and industry greatly and sees that it breathes when it manufactures, sells and trades .. and feels alive only when it manufactures and sells .. and sells .. then sells .. A nation in love with sales .. And a nation that inherits the treasures, the oil, the money, the gold and wealth of every kind needs the nation that is in love with industry, regards industry as the air it breathes, and dies if it does not manufacture and sell .. The nation of money and treasures, side by side with the nation of industry and sales, emerge from a destroyed, shattered and burnt world. The nation of industry needs money so that the wheel of the economy turns in its lands, people exchange money, buy and sell, and their crisis caused by the World War ends .. And the nation of money and treasures needs industry, working hands, and those with high industrial capabilities that are effective in getting things done quickly .. So the nations meet over their interests after a hard, grinding war from which everyone emerged shattered .. and everyone has come to seek a period of rest, calm, security and peace.""")

