t(28, 150, """… the people!
🔴 And if the people of Islam alone, apart from other people, will live for three years on tasbih, tahlil, takbir and praise, this means that everyone who is not Muslim will perish, because he will not perform this dhikr
🔴 And if the other nations will not need this dhikr, how will they live? Or will the Dajjal emerge when all the nations of the earth have perished, so that he calls the Muslims alone to worship him? That is wrong, because it contradicts much evidence that he roams the earth east and west, and that in its east and west are nations who are not of the people of Islam!
And if the people of China, India and Rome then possess food, what is it with the Muslims and their leader the Mahdi that they have failed to possess it?
And if rain continues for the Chinese, the Indians, the Romans and the Africans, why has it been cut off only from the Mahdi and the Ummah?

In conclusion I say: the supporters of this (text) cannot answer these questions.

Peace be upon you""")

