t(33, 1385, """A notice to the brothers and sisters
Some brothers and sisters ask about ways of communicating during the war after the internet is cut off .. There will be no communication of any kind, brothers, if the internet is cut off (that is the condition). I saw the stage of the war in a vision. I saw myself praying, in prostration, throughout the vision, which means devoting oneself to worship .. So our communication here, by the power of Allah Almighty, is ongoing and continuous as long as the internet works .. In this gathering we study everything in which there is good, Allah Almighty willing, for our Ummah: sound ideas, success in understanding granted by the Great Lord, and showing a vision of the coming future, by Allah Almighty's leave, through "ijtihad" built on texts ((with sound chains)), from which we set out to understand the features of what is coming; and images are published, many of them drawn from hadiths with sound chains, a part of them drawn from hadiths with weak chains, and some of them ijtihad unrelated to the hadiths, yet not superficial ijtihad, but rather a personal vision and conception built on an understanding related to many contexts, some of them visions, and some of them what I reckon, Allah Almighty willing, to be something cast into the heart in what Allah Almighty grants one to understand; stressing that this group, as it began scholarly, will remain a (((purely scholarly))) group, playing no other roles until the network stops. This gathering will not depart from that vision and will not turn in any other directions than the scholarly, intellectual and educational ones, in what concerns people in general without singling anyone out .. A purely scholarly gathering that aims only at understanding and knowledge related to the events of the End Times and some important matters of current reality. We ask Allah Almighty for complete relief for all Muslims wherever they are.""")

t(34, 2310, """This is not the flag of any state. This sweeping is very important for Europe. I spoke about it at great length 4 years ago on this channel. I said that it is strategic for Europe. Europe will return to the Europeans alone. That too I said 4 years ago here on this channel. And I said that a decisive historic moment is coming, central and strategic, which will be a matter of life or death for Europe and will take the form of an opportunity that will never recur for Europe's leaders. This opportunity will come, and it is relatively near; in it Europe will rid itself of everyone who is not European and will keep groups that match Europe intellectually and culturally … and will use them as cards to achieve dozens of external aims in the world's political and security future.

In history, in Hitler's time, (they) - the far-removed ones - had no homeland to receive them; but in the time of the European Union""")

t(35, 150, """there are two distinguishing issues concerning the Arabs and Muslims in Europe that differ from what happened to the far-removed ones. The Arabs and Muslims:
🔴 Have countries to return to.
🔴 Their extermination is a danger to Europe's need, in the Great War, for the Arab states and for alliance with them.
🔴 Many Europeans live in the Islamic world or move between its countries, and the extermination of Arabs in Europe means exposing them to much harm, and perhaps brutal treatment of many of them, as retaliatory reactions

The result: expulsion is closer to coming about than extermination, apart from possible Zionist moves using far-right movements to cause losses outside the will of the European political establishment, with the aim of igniting hostility among the migrants so that they respond; then the hostility of the European street flares against them and it finds that they deserve extermination. This is what must .. must be understood by all Arabs and Muslims in Europe .. and absorbed


The solution: an Arab awakening, governmental and popular, should your sons in Europe be exposed to any danger of extermination, so that those states understand that what Hitler did to the far-removed ones, which is a real crime against women, children, old people and men who bear no arms, was a crime; and just as Hitler did indeed commit a crime, our brothers in the West must not be left without a voice to rescue them, after Allah Almighty, in that stage of global disarray and collapse of the security system in the areas of major conflict.""")

